WEBVTT

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.020
Welcome!

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.940
Take a look!

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:33.300
Eruna, I can't carry any more, ryui.
You bought too much <i>takoyaki</i>.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.140
I'm at my limit, ryui.

00:00:35.350 --> 00:00:37.470
Believe in yourself, Bimii!

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:40.270
You're at your limit because you <i>think</i> you are.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.190
If you give up, that's the end of the <i>takoyaki</i>.

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:45.730
The <i>takoyaki</i> continues until you get home!

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:50.150
I don't really understand what position
<i>takoyaki</i> has in your mind, Eruna.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.450
Anyway, do you have enough points, ryui?

00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:53.110
Huh?

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:57.950
After buying and eating this much,
I'm sure you used a lot of points, ryui.

00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:00.910
I forgot...

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:04.040
That's what I thought, ryui.

00:01:04.250 --> 00:01:05.250
Hm?

00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.500
Seisa!

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:14.090
Did you watch my first
victory in the rookie battle?

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:17.850
Of course I did, Eruna. Now...

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:20.600
Let me give you a hug for good luck.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:21.810
Huh?

00:01:23.140 --> 00:01:26.610
Unless a hug isn't enough?

00:01:26.810 --> 00:01:30.110
Oh, Seisa...!

00:01:32.030 --> 00:01:35.950
Poor thing. She hit her head during
the rookie battle just now, right?

00:01:36.160 --> 00:01:40.080
No, unfortunately, this is the usual Eruna, ryui.

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.630
Seisa, hurry! Hurry!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:29.140
<i>Yakisoba, takoyaki, okonomiyaki,</i>
<i>takoyaki, takoyaki</i>, and more <i>takoyaki'</i>.

00:03:29.350 --> 00:03:32.060
Your choices seem very skewed, ryui...

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.320
Seisa, what do you want to eat?

00:03:34.520 --> 00:03:36.740
I want to eat something sweet.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.820
That's my Seisa! You understand!

00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:41.700
A sweet sauce is best for <i>takoyaki</i>, isn't it?

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:43.950
That's why I stocked up!

00:03:44.160 --> 00:03:47.000
Oh, don't worry about the points.
I'll get them from Bimii.

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:50.170
I'm very worried about that part, ryui!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.710
Wel...

00:03:51.920 --> 00:03:52.380
Hm?

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:53.420
...come...

00:03:53.630 --> 00:03:55.420
Would you... like to play...?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.550
M-Minatogawa?

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:00.220
Why is he running the booth by himself?

00:04:00.430 --> 00:04:04.470
Minatogawa is really the only member
of the flower arrangement club, ryui.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:08.350
Oh yeah, the other club members
never show up, right?

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:11.900
Even so, he seems way too out of it.

00:04:12.100 --> 00:04:14.520
Welcome...

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:17.280
And because he's working
hard to serve with a smile,

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:20.200
he's got a weird half-smile on his face...

00:04:23.490 --> 00:04:26.080
Y-You're working hard, Minatogawa!

00:04:26.280 --> 00:04:28.120
Hey. Welcome.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.410
The flower arrangement club
has a shooting gallery?

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.420
That looks fun...!

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.380
Th-That's huge!

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:39.210
Guess what? The grand prize is
a life-sized Super Miracle Man doll.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:43.050
It's too big to be a shooting target...

00:04:43.260 --> 00:04:46.720
Besides, it somehow seems really old...

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:49.810
Guess what? It's a used toy
I brought from my parents' house.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:54.230
No, wait. Even if you say that proudly,
it's not making me want it!

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:57.110
Guess what? It's a little ripped here.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.730
You can't use that!
You can't have a ripped prize!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.610
Guess what? This is my prized possession.

00:05:02.820 --> 00:05:04.660
You have no intention
of giving it away as a prize.

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:05.570
And guess what?

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.990
There's more? What else?

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:09.580
I need to pee...

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.960
Please go use the restroom!
We'll take care of the booth!

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:18.750
He's hard to read, as usual, ryui.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:26.140
Even so, no one's coming
to this booth at all, huh?

00:05:26.340 --> 00:05:32.350
Like that conspicuous Miracle Man,
the other toys are as old and ratty...

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:35.230
Or rather, well-loved...

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:40.400
These are all Minatogawa's personal property.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:43.150
"Sadamashi Minatogawa"... You're right!

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:45.950
And the fact that he wrote it wrong is so cute!

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:52.410
Why did he go so far as to use precious
toys from his childhood just to run a booth?

00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:54.000
Since he's always alone,

00:05:54.210 --> 00:05:58.340
it might be that he wants to have fun
with everyone like this once in a while.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:03.550
I see... All right! I'll help him out, then!

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:12.220
Come by and take a shot! It's the
flower arrangement club's shooting gallery!

00:06:12.430 --> 00:06:15.310
Look for the flower-like poster girl!

00:06:15.520 --> 00:06:19.610
The beautiful girl who shot
through my heart is free!

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:21.820
You're making her free
without permission, ryui...

00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:27.160
I knew that familiar dumb-sounding
voice had to be you, Ichinomiya.

00:06:27.360 --> 00:06:28.530
And even Seisa's with you.

00:06:28.740 --> 00:06:29.990
Working part-time at the shooting gallery?

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:34.080
I knew that familiar sarcasm
had to be you, Akama!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:35.660
Wanna try the shooting gallery?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:38.040
I'll give you a special deal!

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:40.290
Hey, how's that a deal?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:43.590
You obviously raised the
price just now, didn't you?

00:06:43.800 --> 00:06:45.840
You're just imagining it!

00:06:46.050 --> 00:06:50.510
Besides, before arguing about the price,
with those prizes, who would—

00:06:50.720 --> 00:06:51.720
Th-That's—!

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:58.940
What's wrong, ryui?
Do you want that Miracle Man, ryui?

00:06:59.150 --> 00:07:00.400
I-I don't want that!

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:02.610
I don't want it, but you know—

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:07.740
I want to test it out to see if something
that big can actually be knocked over...

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:14.990
Oh, you look good even with
a weapon that's not a scythe!

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.040
A bunch of customers
showed up before we knew it, ryui!

00:07:19.250 --> 00:07:22.210
If this works, we'll rake in the points, ryui!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.500
Knock it over with style, Akama!

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:28.010
Who do you think you're talking to?
I'm great under pressure!

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.510
Focus, focus...

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:38.020
Miracle Man is mine!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:41.900
Wh—?!

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:43.570
It didn't even budge.

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.440
This is bad, ryui. The customers
are starting to complain, ryui.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:48.650
Maybe it won't fall over even if you hit it...

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.280
Do you think it's rigged?

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:51.490
Akama!

00:07:51.700 --> 00:07:52.700
Okay!

00:08:01.170 --> 00:08:05.300
Ichinomiya, will you listen to my last request?

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:09.470
I'm leaving Super Miracle Man... to you...

00:08:09.670 --> 00:08:11.050
Akama!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:15.510
Akama, I will avenge you!

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.310
What? Is he dead, ryui?

00:08:17.520 --> 00:08:18.930
Did Akama die, ryui?

00:08:23.400 --> 00:08:25.110
E-Eruna, don't tell me...

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:27.110
Go...!

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:34.780
It... didn't fall over... Why not...?

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:40.500
You don't want that Miracle Man to be
taken away no matter what, huh, Minatogawa?

00:08:41.920 --> 00:08:43.500
You noticed?

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.000
Huh? Just now...

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:48.800
Selfish Flower.

00:08:49.010 --> 00:08:52.930
I guess I can't fool Seisa Mikagura's eyes.

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:56.390
Ichinomiya, will you stand back?

00:08:57.640 --> 00:08:59.600
You look ready to fight, Seisa.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:04.690
If you say you'll let Miracle Man
go quietly, then I don't have to.

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:07.400
I won't give Miracle Man to anyone.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.860
Besides, I will get to fight you.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:13.240
I have no objection to that.

00:09:14.990 --> 00:09:19.370
Wait a minute, ryui! Seisa, don't tell me
you're going to use Killing Art here?!

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.590
Seisa didn't go for Miracle Man
and went for something easier instead...?

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.340
She avoided the fight, ryui?

00:09:29.550 --> 00:09:31.010
That's not like her, ryui.

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:33.970
I wonder. Look at the face on Minatogawa.

00:09:34.180 --> 00:09:35.180
Sniff.

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:38.510
Why?! Minatogawa looks really sad!

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:44.190
This toy was only second to
Miracle Man in Minatogawa's affections.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:46.020
Is that right...?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:49.360
I'm sure there's a past
only the two of them know, ryui.

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:51.990
Excuse me! Let me shoot one round, please!

00:09:52.190 --> 00:09:53.110
Me, too!

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:55.280
W-Welcome...

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.590
Aw man, where did Seisa run off to?

00:10:13.800 --> 00:10:15.720
She was just here, ryui.

00:10:15.930 --> 00:10:18.760
But didn't everyone look
like they were having fun?

00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.060
Yeah, you're right.

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:26.190
Minatogawa spends a lot of time by
himself in the flower arrangement club,

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:30.020
so it seems he's happy just to have visitors.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:32.860
That's why...

00:10:34.280 --> 00:10:37.030
...you should go visit him
sometimes, too, Ichinomiya!

00:10:37.240 --> 00:10:39.070
After you form your new club!

00:10:39.280 --> 00:10:40.780
Okay, leave it to me!

00:10:42.120 --> 00:10:47.960
Oh right, I hadn't decided
what to do for my new club yet...

00:10:48.170 --> 00:10:49.420
You forgot about it, ryui?

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.340
Oh, there you are!

00:10:52.550 --> 00:10:56.090
No fair, eating yummy food by yourself first!

00:10:56.300 --> 00:10:57.970
Usamaru! Tonkyun!

00:10:58.180 --> 00:11:01.550
Especially after the three of us
managed to get through the first round!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:04.810
If this isn't what you call
passionate youth, then what is?

00:11:05.020 --> 00:11:07.100
The three of us got through the first round...?

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:12.570
Are you telling me you didn't come
watch our matches, Ichinomiya?

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:16.110
O-O-O-Of course not, General MacArthur!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:20.870
Of course I didn't forget about your
matches while eating <i>takoyaki</i> and playing...

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.120
You forgot...

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.660
...to come, huh?

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:31.080
U-Um...

00:11:32.210 --> 00:11:33.210
Huh?

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:38.840
Are you <i>sure</i> you want a crepe?

00:11:39.050 --> 00:11:40.050
Huh?

00:11:41.840 --> 00:11:44.810
Crepes are desserts that
little girls eat, you know?

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:49.770
Even if you say, "This isn't a <i>grape</i>! I wanted
to eat <i>grapes</i>! I want my money back!" later,

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:52.360
I can't do anything...

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:53.310
You know what?

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:54.520
Don't worry.

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:55.900
Huh?

00:11:56.110 --> 00:11:59.650
You don't have to be
afraid of him. He won't bite.

00:11:59.860 --> 00:12:02.740
Don't compare me to a dog.

00:12:02.950 --> 00:12:06.330
I might have one of those special crepes, too.

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:11.210
Because even though I wanted to eat something
sweet, I just kept eating a lot of <i>takoyaki</i>.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:16.210
Um, sorry. There are only enough
ingredients left for one more crepe...

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.800
So I can only make it for one of you...

00:12:23.140 --> 00:12:25.350
Actually, he bites, so be careful.

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:26.010
What?!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.020
Hey, what're you saying? Hey!

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:30.690
I'm sorry!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.850
Now she really <i>is</i> scared!

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:54.130
Good afternoon, I'm Haruka Toishi
from the broadcast club.

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.040
We're a small club that doesn't stand out much,

00:12:57.250 --> 00:13:02.590
but I'll work hard to win the rookie
battle so everyone will know who we are!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.590
Oh, she's pretty!

00:13:05.390 --> 00:13:11.430
She's Haruka Toishi from the broadcast club,
expected to rank second in this rookie battle.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.360
Wow, Asuhi's ranked first!

00:13:18.440 --> 00:13:23.570
There are beautiful girls and boys
I haven't seen before here, too!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:27.580
Oh, this is it!

00:13:27.780 --> 00:13:28.870
What's the matter, ryui?

00:13:29.080 --> 00:13:31.410
An idea for my new club...

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:33.210
Have you thought of something, ryui?

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:37.000
It's taking shape in my head right now—

00:13:38.460 --> 00:13:40.420
Aw man, you made me forget!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.720
This girl's cute!

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.630
Oh, she is!

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:46.590
She's just my type!

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:51.060
Azumi Sagara from the band.
Expected ranking: 5th.

00:13:51.270 --> 00:13:53.600
I believe she's your next opponent, Usamaru.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.230
Seriously?!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:57.190
It looks like there's a video of her.

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:58.650
Let's watch it!

00:14:00.230 --> 00:14:02.940
I'm Azumi Sagara from the band.

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.700
It'll make me happy if my musical
performance during the rookie battle

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:09.950
can be enjoyed by as many people as possible!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.370
She's my next opponent...?

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:14.790
This is crazy! Seriously crazy!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:19.670
I feel like a forbidden love will bud at the end
of a dramatic match during the rookie battle!

00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:24.170
No doubt about it!
It's passionate youth! Super passionate!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:27.970
The drama club doesn't have a booth?

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:32.060
The drama club doesn't need more funds,
so apparently we're taking a break this year.

00:14:34.020 --> 00:14:35.640
Hey, are you just leaving me alone?!

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:40.230
Honestly, don't you have a
speck of interest in my love life?!

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:42.150
- No.
- Nope.

00:14:42.360 --> 00:14:44.990
You guys are too honest...

00:14:48.360 --> 00:14:50.120
Oh, they're drawing portraits!

00:14:50.320 --> 00:14:51.830
It's the art club, huh?

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.790
I'll have them draw me!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:57.790
Welcome. What kind of portrait would you like?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:00.420
I'd like a portrait where
you try to make me feel good

00:15:00.630 --> 00:15:04.960
by making me look so good you can't
tell what the picture was based on!

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:06.090
I see...

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.260
Could you even call that a portrait?

00:15:09.470 --> 00:15:10.760
I want one drawn, too!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:17.600
One where Seisa holds me tight,
gives me a kiss, and...

00:15:17.810 --> 00:15:21.480
I don't know if I understand
what a portrait is anymore...

00:15:21.690 --> 00:15:25.190
I know! Since I'm here,
maybe I'll have Enoyan draw me!

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:27.070
"Enoyan"...?

00:15:27.280 --> 00:15:28.570
Kuzuryu!

00:15:30.870 --> 00:15:37.120
Sorry, but Kuzuryu is very busy,
so he doesn't come to places like this.

00:15:37.330 --> 00:15:39.370
Oh, is that right?

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.340
Let's see... What kind of
picture did you want again?

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:50.380
Oh, right! Well, you see, this story
starts with a girl falling in love with me!

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:52.180
A story...?

00:15:52.390 --> 00:15:55.560
Well, it's a gigantic picture scroll story!

00:15:55.770 --> 00:15:59.770
When I say "girl," I mean she's
someone who's like a goddess!

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:01.440
And well, she...

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:04.860
On my cheek, you know...

00:16:06.110 --> 00:16:08.650
She k-kisses...

00:16:10.610 --> 00:16:14.080
You were watching earlier, weren't you?
At Minatogawa's booth.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:19.460
Don't you actually want to have fun
with your underclassmen, too, Kuzuryu?

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:23.460
What about you? What's with
this curious turn of events?

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:28.760
You seem to be having an awful lot
of fun with Eruna and the others.

00:16:28.970 --> 00:16:30.130
I do...?

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:33.800
Not that it has anything to do with me, though.

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:39.310
Seisa!

00:16:42.650 --> 00:16:43.900
Seisa!

00:16:44.110 --> 00:16:46.860
I wonder... What <i>has</i> gotten into me?

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:51.820
Tension max! Go!

00:16:57.660 --> 00:17:01.120
Whew... I made it past the second round!

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.670
This is pretty hard work.

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:07.630
But it's fun, so I want to fight more and more!

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.460
Let me have it!

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:11.970
You've got way too much energy, huh, ryui?

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.340
I wasn't sure what would
happen in the second round

00:17:14.550 --> 00:17:19.060
when you were almost late
and came running over unsteadily, ryui.

00:17:19.270 --> 00:17:20.930
I wonder how everyone else is doing.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:25.600
Looks like Asuhi and Tonkyun
both won in the second round, too, ryui.

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:29.280
At this rate, there's no doubt you'll
have to fight them sometime, ryui!

00:17:29.480 --> 00:17:30.990
That's just what we wanted.

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.320
All that's left is... Usamaru!

00:17:33.530 --> 00:17:35.740
Usamaru's match is just ahead.

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.950
We'll make it, right? Let's go cheer for him!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:43.120
Eru-eru! Eru-eru! It's a call
from Eruna's dear prince!

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:49.340
Hello? Can you please not go into my device
and change my ringtone without permission?

00:17:49.550 --> 00:17:52.510
I'll completely sever the
half-severed familial ties we have!

00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:54.380
They're half-severed?!

00:17:54.590 --> 00:17:59.260
That's the first I've heard of it, Eruna!
Is it even possible to just be half-related?!

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:03.640
Does that mean I'm a <i>hafu</i>? <i>Hafus</i> are
cool and admired, so I'm kind of happy!

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:08.150
What kind of filter do you have
to be able to turn that into a positive?

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:09.570
Who knows?

00:18:09.770 --> 00:18:12.990
More importantly, Eruna, congrats
on getting through the second round.

00:18:13.190 --> 00:18:15.400
Wanna have a pep rally in your honor tonight?

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.700
A pep rally?

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:21.040
Will there be cute girls who appear
and confess their love to me?!

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:25.000
Um... You'll have to come
and find out for yourself.

00:18:25.210 --> 00:18:29.130
Oh, then I want to invite Seisa and Enoyan, too!

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:33.960
I'll try inviting Seisa, but...
Kuzuryu probably won't come.

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.170
Why not?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.550
He doesn't like stuff like this.

00:18:38.680 --> 00:18:43.220
C'mon Eruna, if you don't hurry,
Usamaru's match is going to start, ryui!

00:18:52.900 --> 00:18:55.070
This is where the match is, right?

00:18:55.280 --> 00:18:56.400
It should be, ryui.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:19:00.120
Why is it so quiet...?

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.700
Seisa! Oh yeah, tonight—

00:19:07.960 --> 00:19:09.420
Seisa...?

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:17.470
Tonkyun! What in the world is going—

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:29.770
Usamaru! What happened?!

00:19:29.980 --> 00:19:31.110
It's her attack.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:32.310
Huh?!

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:45.330
This is the attack of Sagara from the band?

00:19:48.660 --> 00:19:51.920
Apparently, she is using the sound
pressure from the sound she manipulates

00:19:52.130 --> 00:19:55.750
to increase the gravity of specific areas.

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:56.960
On top of that...

00:19:58.300 --> 00:20:01.640
She's flying?! By manipulating gravity,
she can keep herself in the air?

00:20:01.840 --> 00:20:05.810
Then Usamaru's attack won't reach her
no matter what! Isn't that cheating?

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:09.230
It's a hopeless match-up of abilities, ryui.

00:20:09.440 --> 00:20:11.810
Watching makes me feel so bad for him, ryui.

00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:15.020
But why hasn't she broken his last crystal yet?

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:18.240
Usamaru can't do a thing in that state...

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.950
She's toying with him.

00:20:20.150 --> 00:20:21.820
She's been doing it for a while now.

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:24.700
She hits Usamaru, who's unable to resist,
and makes a fool of him...

00:20:24.910 --> 00:20:25.910
That's terrible...

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.210
Hey, Bunny! Why don't you give up soon?

00:20:31.420 --> 00:20:36.880
You understand, don't you? That you
don't have the smallest hope of winning?

00:20:37.090 --> 00:20:41.680
But... don't you think it would be cool
if the underdog could win in this play?

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:46.390
What the heck? There's no way.
Besides, it's totally not cool at all.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:55.400
Usamaru! Jump! Jump as high
as you can and kick her down!

00:20:56.480 --> 00:21:00.900
Bunny, look, your ickle friend
is cheering you on.

00:21:01.110 --> 00:21:04.320
If you're a bunny,
why don't you try to hop-hop?

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:09.870
It's not like you'll be able to reach me
no matter how desperately you jump, though.

00:21:12.830 --> 00:21:18.550
Ichinomiya... You came to
cheer me on this time, huh?

00:21:18.750 --> 00:21:22.340
I'm not the only one!
Tonkyun's cheering for you, too!

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:23.880
That makes me happy...

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:29.010
There's nothing more passionately youthful
than an event where your friends cheer you on.

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:29.600
With this, I'll...

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:30.810
Damn.

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:32.940
Usamaru!

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:44.110
I said so from the beginning, didn't I?

00:21:44.320 --> 00:21:51.000
Bunnies are meant to be hunted,
so you should just cry and make me feel good.

00:21:51.200 --> 00:21:53.290
What are you doing actually <i>trying</i>?

00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.750
You're spoiling the fun.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.090
This is why I don't like club battles...

00:22:00.300 --> 00:22:01.300
Huh?

00:23:40.980 --> 00:23:44.690
Usamaru! Why did you lose?!

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:48.650
Why didn't you use
the ability Passionate Sweat?!

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:50.820
I told you there's no ability like that, ryui!

00:23:51.030 --> 00:23:52.660
Then, the ability Sultriness.

00:23:52.870 --> 00:23:55.990
He condenses the steam created
by all the hot air gushing from him,

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:57.580
and then this white misty stuff—

00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:00.120
That sounds like con funk
and that's gross too, ryui!

00:24:00.330 --> 00:24:03.170
Okay, okay, the ability Bare Hands!
After they duke it out at the dry riverbed,

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:04.920
they make up by laughing
and falling down on the bank!

00:24:05.130 --> 00:24:07.170
That's not an ability or anything, ryui!

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:08.670
Why not? It's passionate youth!

00:24:08.880 --> 00:24:11.800
It's in the shadows and light!
Of the town, just before sunset!

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:14.470
The ability Youthful Bittersweet Memory.

00:24:14.680 --> 00:24:15.640
Minatogawa?!

00:24:15.850 --> 00:24:17.520
What kind of ability is that, ryui?

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:18.180
Drool.

00:24:18.390 --> 00:24:18.730
Huh?

00:24:18.930 --> 00:24:21.400
When you imagine yourself eating something sour,

00:24:21.600 --> 00:24:23.110
it makes your mouth water.

00:24:26.020 --> 00:24:29.530
It's no use. I still don't really get
where Minatogawa's coming from!

00:24:29.740 --> 00:24:32.030
Next time, "Junk Innocence."

00:24:32.240 --> 00:24:35.030
Perhaps Kuzuryu's past will be revealed.
